{"title":"Dire Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (1.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>20</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>24</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>20</td><td>in the wilds around 1018, -47</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>24</td><td>in the wilds around 1030, -36</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>21</td><td>in the wilds around 1023, -54</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dire-wolf\" data-map-level=\"22\">Show level 22 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Wolfden</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 6</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-120\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1005.0px,-455.2px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:1020.4px;top:465.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:973.8px;top:529.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:949.4px;top:515.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:948.0px;top:487.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:966.3px;top:528.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1062.2px;top:404.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:962.9px;top:456.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1004.1px;top:471.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1022.4px;top:421.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1070.4px;top:412.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:946.1px;top:517.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:989.9px;top:467.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:1005.5px;top:421.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:958.8px;top:512.9px\"></i></div><figcaption>Wolfden</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1024, -45 <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 9 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 927, -1 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Haunted%20Cavern\">Haunted Cavern</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1040, -83 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dire-wolf\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wolf: <a href=\"#/monster/wolf\">Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf\">Grayback Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-wolf\">Elder Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d535eb40d6ac5fcfceaa.webp\" alt=\"Dire Wolf\"></div><h3>Dire Wolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 20)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>74</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>16.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.9 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>75 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}